# sriq: a UNION with a NEGATION. A ⊑ B ⊔ C and A ⊑ ¬B give A ⊑ C.
# Expect: A ⊑ C.

@prefix :     <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .
:A a owl:Class . :B a owl:Class . :C a owl:Class .
:A rdfs:subClassOf [ owl:unionOf ( :B :C ) ] , [ owl:complementOf :B ] .
